    <string name="n3ds_gamepad_setup_unknown_name">unidentified model</string>
    <string name="n3ds_gamepad_setup_d3_guide">D3/BSP-D3: turn the controller off. Hold X and press HOME. HOME is the small power button near the lights. Then select the controller in Bluetooth settings.</string>
    <string name="n3ds_gamepad_setup_xbox_guide">Xbox: hold the pairing button until the light flashes. Then select the controller in Bluetooth settings.</string>
    <string name="n3ds_gamepad_setup_playstation_guide">PlayStation: hold PS and SHARE or CREATE until the light flashes. Then select the controller in Bluetooth settings.</string>
    <string name="n3ds_gamepad_setup_nintendo_guide">Nintendo: hold SYNC until the lights flash. Then select the controller in Bluetooth settings. A/B and X/Y may be in different positions.</string>
    <string name="n3ds_gamepad_setup_8bitdo_guide">8BitDo: before connecting, select the Android mode shown in your model manual. Then pair it through Bluetooth.</string>
    <string name="n3ds_gamepad_setup_generic_guide">Connect the controller through Bluetooth. If a button is wrong, open Customize controls. If it does not respond, check the controller manual.</string>
